## Memory

- Keep this file concise and use it primarily as an index.
- Store detailed durable knowledge in topic-specific Markdown files.
- Read only the memory relevant to the current task.
- Never store secrets or credentials in memory.
- Runtime state, raw tool output, todo state, and full session transcripts are not long-term memory.
